"doi": "10.1101/2023.03.10.23287127",
"title": "Genotoxic colibactin mutational signature in colorectal cancer is associated with clinicopathological features, specific genomic alterations and better survival",
"authors": [
"Georgeson P",
"Steinfelder RS",
"Harrison TA",
"Pope BJ",
"Zaidi SH",
"Qu C",
