"author_string": "Williams MJ, Vázquez-García I, Tam G, Wu M, Varice N, Havasov E, Shi H, Al-Rawi DH, Satas G, Lees HJ, Lee JJ, Myers MA, Zatzman M, Rusk N, Ali E, Shah RH, Berger MF, Mohibullah N, Lakhman Y, Chi DS, Abu-Rustum NR, Aghajanian C, McPherson A, Zamarin D, Loomis B, Weigelt B, Friedman CF, Shah SP.",
