"title": "DNA-sensing inflammasomes cause recurrent atherosclerotic stroke",
"authors": [
"Cao J",
"Roth S",
"Zhang S",
"Kopczak A",
"Mami S",
"Asare Y",
"Georgakis MK",
"Messerer D",
"Horn A",
