"title": "Two-factor authentication underpins the precision of the piRNA pathway",
"authors": [
"Dias Mirandela M",
"Zoch A",
"Leismann J",
"Webb S",
"Berrens RV",
"Valsakumar D",
"Kabayama Y",
"Auchynnikava T",
"Schito M",
"Chowdhury T",
