"title": "Solanum pan-genetics reveals paralogues as contingencies in crop engineering",
"authors": [
"Benoit M",
"Jenike KM",
"Satterlee JW",
"Ramakrishnan S",
"Gentile I",
"Hendelman A",
"Passalacqua MJ",
"Suresh H",
"Shohat H",
"Robitaille GM",
"Fitzgerald B",
"Alonge M",
