"title": "Reduced cyclin D3 expression in erythroid cells protects against malaria",
"authors": [
"Marini MG",
"Mingoia M",
"Steri M",
"Tsamesidis I",
"Idda ML",
"Manca A",
"D'Avino C",
"Virdis F",
