"title": "Non-invasive profiling of the tumour microenvironment with spatial ecotypes",
"authors": [
"Zhang W",
"Brown EL",
"Usmani A",
"Earland N",
"Kang M",
"Olelewe C",
"Viswanathan A",
"Chauhan PS",
