"title": "A glycolytic metabolite bypasses \"two-hit\" tumor suppression by BRCA2",
"authors": [
"Kong LR",
"Gupta K",
"Wu AJ",
"Perera D",
"Ivanyi-Nagy R",
"Ahmed SM",
"Tan TZ",
"Tan SL",
"Fuddin A",
"Sundaramoorthy E",
"Goh GS",
