"title": "Binimetinib and encorafenib for the treatment of advanced solid tumors with non-V600E BRAF mutations: results from the Phase II BEAVER trial",
"authors": [
"Rose AAN",
"Maxwell J",
"Rousselle E",
"Mukonoweshuro CL",
"Elkholi IE",
"Riaud M",
"Biondini M",
